WEBVTT

00:10:59.125 --> 00:11:02.809
Her confidence was
propped up by sisterhood,

00:11:02.833 --> 00:11:04.601
by community.

00:11:04.625 --> 00:11:08.559
What she was basically saying
was that if I am ever in doubt,

00:11:08.583 --> 00:11:10.893
I need you to be there

00:11:10.917 --> 00:11:12.809
to restore my hope

00:11:12.833 --> 00:11:15.768
and to rebuild my certainty.

00:11:15.792 --> 00:11:20.351
In community, I can find my confidence

00:11:20.375 --> 00:11:23.601
and your curiosity can affirm it.

00:11:23.625 --> 00:11:26.143
Early in my career,
I led a large-scale event

00:11:26.167 --> 00:11:28.393
that did not go exactly as planned.

00:11:28.417 --> 00:11:31.143
I'm lying to you. It was terrible.